    "body": "Slice B result: no code change. Each test ran alone in debug (`cargo test -j 6 -p camcraft-motion --lib -- --exact <name> --test-threads=1`, origin/main at d54580cad, libtest time):\n\n- `machining2d::adaptive::tests::the_slot_and_its_32_nm_twin_decide_the_same_way`: 29.6 s (#3427 said 181.2 s)\n- `machining2d::adaptive::tests::a_channel_is_grown_as_one_spiral_that_never_crosses`: 25.6 s (#3427 said 152.3 s)\n- `machining2d::pocket_hsm::ring_tests::an_air_plan_over_the_load_bound_is_refused_by_name`: 13.1 s (#3427 said 71.3 s)\n\nAll three are under the 60 s limit of AGENTS.md \"Testing\". They stay in the default suite. No branch, no PR. The `#[test]` count does not change. Slice C (the three `tests/adaptive_troch_*.rs` binaries) is still open; measure those tests alone before work starts.\n\nThe claim of slice B is released. `in-review` stays for PR #3726 (slice A).",
